WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.334
Well, China's communist government

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.003
isn't laughing after a comedian

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.238
made a joke, loosely referencing

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:06.873
an Army slogan.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.042
The performer known as House

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:10.176
is being investigated

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.678
and he has apologized

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.813
and he's canceled his shows.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:14.948
His entertainment firm

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.249
has also said it sorry.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:19.786
And it's being fined some $2 million

00:00:20.387 --> 00:00:23.089
or this over a joke about dogs

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:24.257
chasing squirrels

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.292
and the use of a slogan,

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.061
fine style of work

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.296
capable of winning battles.

00:00:31.097 --> 00:00:31.998
But it didn't stop there.

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.867
Police arrested a woman Tuesday

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.902
for questioning on social media,

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:38.538
why House was being punished

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:41.808
For more on all of this, CNN's Kristie

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:44.911
Lu Stout joins us live from Hong Kong.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:45.812
Good to have you with us.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.146
Kristie,

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.048
so it's certainly not an easy place

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.616
to be a comedian

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:50.683
The communist government

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.719
taking swift action.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:53.253
Yeah.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.054
You know, comedy

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.056
apparently is a high risk endeavor

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.857
in China under Xi Jinping.

00:00:57.857 --> 00:00:59.292
Let's tell you what happened

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:00.960
and led to this crackdown.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.162
It was during this

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.663
standup set that took place

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:06.232
in Beijing on Saturday, a Chinese comic

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:07.467
known as House.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.469
His name in Mandarin is Li Hao. Sure.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:10.870
Seen on your screen there.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.606
He was riffing on this eight word

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:14.607
military slogan,

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.309
a slogan that's been used by the Chinese

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:17.110
leader, Xi Jinping.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.111
He was making a joke

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.246
about watching his two rescue dogs

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.781
chase a squirrel.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:23.149
And it reminded him of the slogan

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.617
that she used to comment on

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:26.853
and praise the work ethic of the play.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.923
The joke went online, it went viral.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.824
And then on Wednesday,

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:31.958
the Beijing police launched

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:32.892
an investigation.

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:33.426
Authorities,

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.761
they also fined the company

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.764
that represents Li nearly 2 million U.S.

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.665
dollars.

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:39.566
We heard this

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:41.201
from the Beijing Municipal

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:43.169
Bureau of Culture and Tourism

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.404
to bring up the statement for you

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:45.071
said, quote,

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:47.474
We will never allow any company

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:48.541
or individual

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:50.043
to wantonly slander

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.344
the glorious image

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:51.911
of the People's

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.012
Liberation Army

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:53.913
on the stage

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.982
in the Chinese capital, unquote.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:56.382
The bureau

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:57.784
also said that the company

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.152
would never be allowed to stage

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.488
any feature shows in Beijing.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:02.455
The company,

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:04.557
which had already issued an apology,

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.559
also fired the comedian.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:09.329
The comedian has apologized profusely

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.798
on his Sina Weibo page on social media.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:13.800
He canceled those performances,

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.235
too, in his words,

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.070
quote, deeply reflect

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.339
and reeducate myself.

00:02:19.339 --> 00:02:21.975
Now it is come to this because in China,

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:25.278
insults against the military are illegal.

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:26.246
It was a few years ago

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.080
in 20, 21

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.882
that was when China passed a law banning

00:02:28.882 --> 00:02:30.150
slander, insults

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.885
against military personnel

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:32.952
and on social media

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.087
for the last few days.

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.656
There are netizens who have been praising

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:37.757
this government decision.

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:38.658
They said, look, the joke

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:39.759
crossed the line.

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:41.427
It was an insult to soldiers.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:44.030
But there were others that dispute that.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:46.499
And they are fearing a wider crackdown.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.268
On comedy in China.

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:49.969
And it's very easy to see why

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:51.437
because this week

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.373
a woman in northeastern China

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:55.008
was detained by police

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.809
after defending the comedian

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.245
and what he said on social media.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:00.480
Back to you, Linda.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.047
All right, Kristie

00:03:01.047 --> 00:03:02.682
Lu Stout for us in Hong Kong.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:04.350
Good to have you with us. Thank you.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:04.784
Thank you.

